  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-08-17T06:48:31.331Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello! \n\nAfter the latest update I have noticed a pretty annoying issue that seems to involve the interact and grab bindings on steamvr for in my case vive wands. This issues does not allow me to properly grab and drag physbones on avatars.\n\nTo provide further information with my specific case, after the update I selected the VRchat Default Advanced bindings that were provided by Vrchat with only very minor modification, no modifications to the trigger binds at all on my end. \n\nThe only way I found to restore normally functionality is to simply unbind interact from the trigger, which for many reasons isn't really an ideal solution for me.\n\nAlso here is a small demonstration video of the issue below.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pvjl7H7DDUI\n\nHope for some kind of fix soon, Thank you advanced :)",
